{"id":"73245f799abb8dc9","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness.md","title":"良基证明树的抽象可靠性","display":"thm-well-founded-proof-soundness — 良基证明树的抽象可靠性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness","aliases":["72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness"],"display":"thm-well-founded-proof-soundness — 良基证明树的抽象可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-proof-tree]]","[[72-df-abstract-rule-validity]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §3.1, Figure1, print164–166/PDF176–178; local well-founded induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-well-founded-proof-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-well-founded-proof-soundness — 良基证明树的抽象可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e2d6ae13554de5c2\" href=\"?note=e2d6ae13554de5c2\" title=\"72-df-abstract-rule-validity\">72-df-abstract-rule-validity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §3.1, Figure1, print164–166/PDF176–178; local well-founded induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,H\">\\(\\mathcal C,H\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2d6ae13554de5c2\" href=\"?note=e2d6ae13554de5c2\" title=\"72-df-abstract-rule-validity\">72-df-abstract-rule-validity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Concl}\">\\(\\operatorname{Concl}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a>，使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\">\\(Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq Q\">\\(H\\subseteq Q\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\pi=\\langle D,\\prec,\\ell,\\mathcal C,\\eta\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\in H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\in H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\subseteq\\mathrm{WFProof}_{\\mathcal C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\in H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathcal C}(H)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}\\ (\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\in H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对孩子关系的良基性归纳证明每个节点标签属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>。公理节点用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq H\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq H\\)</span>；规则节点的全部孩子由归纳假设在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 中，故由规则有效性得其结论。有限前缀树的真孩子关系不可能成环；任意非空节点子集取长度最大者，直接给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WFChild}\">\\(\\operatorname{WFChild}\\)</span>，从而有第二式。这里不把仅仅局部合法的无穷树当作证明；一条无限下降的“自我支持”链没有这一可靠性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-abstract-rule-validity","